{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0315dc72-d922-8665-a9e6-f6fa8b444d2e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T14:20:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Owen. Yeah, so, I'm standing in line at the post office, buying stamps, and I'm calling you because apparently I can't do one errand at a time. Also, have you seen what stamps cost now? I nearly fell over. I think I just paid for a small boat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:18:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, they do keep creeping up. Um, so what can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:18:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. There's a dog loose on my street. Stray, I think. Brown and white, medium size, no collar that I can see. It's been wandering around for two days now. I put out a bowl of water, which probably wasn't smart, and it just hangs around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Two days. Is the dog acting aggressive at all, or is it more just lost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lost, I'd say. Skittish. But it was out in the road yesterday and a car had to swerve, and that's what's got me worried. Somebody's going to get hurt, or the dog is. Who actually responds to something like this? Is that you guys, the police, somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be animal control. They work through the police department here. I don't dispatch them from this desk, but I can give you the right line, or I can transfer you if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:19:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Transfer is good. I'm in a line full of people holding envelopes, so writing down numbers is, uh, a challenge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Before I do, let me take your name and number in case the call drops. Could I have those?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nilson Monteiro. M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O. Number's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:19:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Nilson Monteiro, zero one seven three at the end. Got it. And you'll want to tell them the street and which way the dog tends to go. They'll ask about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, will do. It mostly sticks near the corner by my place. I'll tell them that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Hold on just a moment while I connect you. If it doesn't pick up, they should have a message option."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thanks, Owen. And if the dog's owner is looking, tell them the dog's fine, it's just my wallet that's hurting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T14:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll pass that along. Transferring you now."
    }
  ],
